# Build context for docker/Dockerfile (context: repo root).
# Every service bind-mounts the repo over /workspace, so `COPY . /workspace/`
# only has to feed `pip install -e .` (pyproject.toml + src/). Without this file
# the context was ≈ 5 GB and the 2026-11-14 CadQuery rebuild spent minutes
# exporting it. Excluding the private trees also keeps AED results out of the
# image layers.
.git
.worktrees
logs
examples
docs/references
docs/private
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
*.bp
*.h5
*.xdmf
*.msh
